§ `26. search of a ship, hovercraft, aircraft, vehicle or train; and of persons arriving or departing`

`suspects a drug in a ship` MEANS `Search Vessel Facts` WITH
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, vehicle or train a controlled drug in contravention of this Act, a controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS TRUE
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the autonomous vehicle, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel a controlled drug or controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS FALSE
    `the person is arriving in Singapore or about to depart from Singapore` IS FALSE

`suspects a drug in an unmanned aircraft` MEANS `Search Vessel Facts` WITH
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, vehicle or train a controlled drug in contravention of this Act, a controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS FALSE
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the autonomous vehicle, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel a controlled drug or controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS TRUE
    `the person is arriving in Singapore or about to depart from Singapore` IS FALSE

`person arriving` MEANS `Search Vessel Facts` WITH
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, vehicle or train a controlled drug in contravention of this Act, a controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS FALSE
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the autonomous vehicle, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel a controlled drug or controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS FALSE
    `the person is arriving in Singapore or about to depart from Singapore` IS TRUE

`nothing suspected` MEANS `Search Vessel Facts` WITH
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, vehicle or train a controlled drug in contravention of this Act, a controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS FALSE
    `the officer has reason to suspect that there is in the autonomous vehicle, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel a controlled drug or controlled substance, a psychoactive substance or an article liable to seizure` IS FALSE
    `the person is arriving in Singapore or about to depart from Singapore` IS FALSE

