§ `27 and 28. forfeiture`

`offence proved, drug used in it` MEANS `Forfeiture Facts` WITH
    `it is proved to the satisfaction of a court that an offence under this Act has been committed` IS TRUE
    `the drug, substance or article was the subject matter of or was used in the commission of the offence` IS TRUE
    `there is no prosecution with regard to the drug, substance or article seized` IS FALSE
    `one month has expired from the date of the seizure` IS FALSE
    `a claim to it was made before that date in the prescribed manner` IS FALSE
    `a person has been convicted of an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel, or a component, has been proved to have been used in any manner in connection with the offence` IS FALSE
    `the vehicle, autonomous vehicle or a component has been proved to have been used in any manner in connection with the offence` IS FALSE
    `the Public Prosecutor applies for the order` IS FALSE
    `the ship, hovercraft or unmanned vessel is of more than 200 tons net, or the aircraft or unmanned aircraft belongs to a person carrying on a regular passenger service to and from Singapore by means of it` IS FALSE
    `the owner establishes that it was unlawfully in the possession of another person without the owner's consent` IS FALSE

`offence proved, drug not connected` MEANS `Forfeiture Facts` WITH
    `it is proved to the satisfaction of a court that an offence under this Act has been committed` IS TRUE
    `the drug, substance or article was the subject matter of or was used in the commission of the offence` IS FALSE
    `there is no prosecution with regard to the drug, substance or article seized` IS FALSE
    `one month has expired from the date of the seizure` IS FALSE
    `a claim to it was made before that date in the prescribed manner` IS FALSE
    `a person has been convicted of an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel, or a component, has been proved to have been used in any manner in connection with the offence` IS FALSE
    `the vehicle, autonomous vehicle or a component has been proved to have been used in any manner in connection with the offence` IS FALSE
    `the Public Prosecutor applies for the order` IS FALSE
    `the ship, hovercraft or unmanned vessel is of more than 200 tons net, or the aircraft or unmanned aircraft belongs to a person carrying on a regular passenger service to and from Singapore by means of it` IS FALSE
    `the owner establishes that it was unlawfully in the possession of another person without the owner's consent` IS FALSE

`drug connected, offence not proved` MEANS `Forfeiture Facts` WITH
    `it is proved to the satisfaction of a court that an offence under this Act has been committed` IS FALSE
    `the drug, substance or article was the subject matter of or was used in the commission of the offence` IS TRUE
    `there is no prosecution with regard to the drug, substance or article seized` IS FALSE
    `one month has expired from the date of the seizure` IS FALSE
    `a claim to it was made before that date in the prescribed manner` IS FALSE
    `a person has been convicted of an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the ship, hovercraft, aircraft, unmanned aircraft or unmanned vessel, or a component, has been proved to have been used in any manner in connection with the offence` IS FALSE
    `the vehicle, autonomous vehicle or a component has been proved to have been used in any manner in connection with the offence` IS FALSE
    `the Public Prosecutor applies for the order` IS FALSE
    `the ship, hovercraft or unmanned vessel is of more than 200 tons net, or the aircraft or unmanned aircraft belongs to a person carrying on a regular passenger service to and from Singapore by means of it` IS FALSE
    `the owner establishes that it was unlawfully in the possession of another person without the owner's consent` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `an order for the forfeiture of the drug, substance or article is to be made` `offence proved, drug used in it`

#ASSERT NOT `an order for the forfeiture of the drug, substance or article is to be made` `offence proved, drug not connected`

#ASSERT NOT `an order for the forfeiture of the drug, substance or article is to be made` `drug connected, offence not proved`

