    `the accused failed to comply with a lawful requirement of such an officer in the execution of his or her duty under this Act` IS TRUE
    `the accused, without reasonable excuse, failed to furnish information in his or her possession required by such an officer` IS FALSE
    `the accused furnished to such an officer information which he or she knew or had reason to believe to be false` IS FALSE

