`urine specimen divided and tested properly` MEANS `Specimen Facts` WITH
    `the officer reasonably suspects that the person has committed an offence under section 8(b) or 11I(1)(b)` IS FALSE
    `the Director has ordered a relevant person to present himself or herself and to provide a specimen, to ensure the person is no longer a drug addict` IS FALSE
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to provide the specimen within the time required` IS FALSE
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to comply with the Director's order` IS FALSE
    `the specimen of urine was divided into 3 parts and a preliminary urine test was conducted on one part` IS TRUE
    `each of the remaining 2 parts was marked and sealed and a urine test was conducted on each part by a different person, being an analyst of the Health Sciences Authority or a person appointed by the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the preliminary urine test was negative for controlled drugs and psychoactive substances` IS FALSE

`urine specimen divided, parts not sealed and tested` MEANS `Specimen Facts` WITH
    `the officer reasonably suspects that the person has committed an offence under section 8(b) or 11I(1)(b)` IS FALSE
    `the Director has ordered a relevant person to present himself or herself and to provide a specimen, to ensure the person is no longer a drug addict` IS FALSE
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to provide the specimen within the time required` IS FALSE
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to comply with the Director's order` IS FALSE
    `the specimen of urine was divided into 3 parts and a preliminary urine test was conducted on one part` IS TRUE
    `each of the remaining 2 parts was marked and sealed and a urine test was conducted on each part by a different person, being an analyst of the Health Sciences Authority or a person appointed by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `the preliminary urine test was negative for controlled drugs and psychoactive substances` IS FALSE

`urine specimen not divided` MEANS `Specimen Facts` WITH
    `the officer reasonably suspects that the person has committed an offence under section 8(b) or 11I(1)(b)` IS FALSE
    `the Director has ordered a relevant person to present himself or herself and to provide a specimen, to ensure the person is no longer a drug addict` IS FALSE
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to provide the specimen within the time required` IS FALSE
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to comply with the Director's order` IS FALSE
    `the specimen of urine was divided into 3 parts and a preliminary urine test was conducted on one part` IS FALSE
    `each of the remaining 2 parts was marked and sealed and a urine test was conducted on each part by a different person, being an analyst of the Health Sciences Authority or a person appointed by the Minister` IS TRUE
    `the preliminary urine test was negative for controlled drugs and psychoactive substances` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the urine specimen has been dealt with as section 31(4) requires` `urine specimen divided and tested properly`

#ASSERT NOT `the urine specimen has been dealt with as section 31(4) requires` `urine specimen divided, parts not sealed and tested`

#ASSERT NOT `the urine specimen has been dealt with as section 31(4) requires` `urine specimen not divided`

`preliminary test negative` MEANS `Specimen Facts` WITH
    `the officer reasonably suspects that the person has committed an offence under section 8(b) or 11I(1)(b)` IS FALSE
    `the Director has ordered a relevant person to present himself or herself and to provide a specimen, to ensure the person is no longer a drug addict` IS FALSE
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to provide the specimen within the time required` IS FALSE
    `the person failed, without reasonable excuse, to comply with the Director's order` IS FALSE
    `the specimen of urine was divided into 3 parts and a preliminary urine test was conducted on one part` IS FALSE
    `each of the remaining 2 parts was marked and sealed and a urine test was conducted on each part by a different person, being an analyst of the Health Sciences Authority or a person appointed by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `the preliminary urine test was negative for controlled drugs and psychoactive substances` IS TRUE

