§ `53 and the statement the Act gives the Code`

`the punishment is death` MEANS `Court Facts` WITH
    `the punishment in question is the punishment of death` IS TRUE

`the punishment is not death` MEANS `Court Facts` WITH
    `the punishment in question is the punishment of death` IS FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `a District Court has power to impose the punishment` `the punishment is death`

